<h2 style="color:#ff3333;">
    14. FERDINAND ALEXANDER PORSCHE
</h2>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    <b>Ferdinand Alexander Porsche</b> was the designer
    responsible for the design of the original Porsche 901,
    which later became the 911.
</p>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    His design became one of the most recognizable silhouettes
    in the history of automobiles.
</p>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    The achievement was not simply creating a beautiful car.
    It was creating a design that could evolve for decades
    without losing its identity.
</p>

