    width="420">
</p>


<h2 style="color:#ff3333;">
    15. WHY IS THE 911 A LEGEND?
</h2>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    The 911 has survived for more than six decades because
    Porsche continuously improved it.
</p>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    The car has experienced huge changes:
    air cooling, turbocharging, water cooling, all-wheel drive,
    electronic systems, lightweight construction and hybrid power.
</p>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    Yet when people see a 911, they can still recognize it.
</p>

<p style="text-align:center; font-size:140%; color:#ff5555;">
    <b>
        THE 911 PROVES THAT A GREAT DESIGN CAN EVOLVE
        WITHOUT LOSING ITS IDENTITY.
    </b>
</p>

