<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    The BMW M4 did not appear suddenly.
    Its roots go back to BMW's motorsport programme.
</p>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    BMW Motorsport GmbH was founded in <b>1972</b>.
</p>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
