    activities and build high-performance engineering expertise.
</p>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    Motorsport became a laboratory where BMW could test
    engines, suspension, aerodynamics, braking and lightweight
    construction.
</p>


<h2 style="color:#4da6ff;">
    2. JOCHEN NEERPASCH
</h2>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    <b>Jochen Neerpasch</b> was one of the important people
    in the early development of BMW Motorsport.
</p>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    He became the head of BMW Motorsport and helped build
    the organisation's professional racing structure.
</p>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    His motorsport experience became part of the culture
    that later defined BMW M.
</p>

