<h2 style="color:#4da6ff;">
    3. THE BMW 3.0 CSL
</h2>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    One of the earliest major BMW Motorsport cars was the
    <b>BMW 3.0 CSL</b>.
</p>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    The car combined a powerful engine with lightweight
    construction and aerodynamic improvements.
