    BMW created more powerful and more focused versions
    of the M4, including the <b>M4 Competition</b>.
</p>


<h2 style="color:#4da6ff;">
    10. THE M4 GTS
</h2>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    BMW also created the special <b>M4 GTS</b>.
</p>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    It was designed with a stronger focus on track performance,
    using lightweight engineering and advanced technology.
</p>


<h2 style="color:#4da6ff;">
    11. THE M4 CS
