<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    The <b>M4 CS</b> provides another interpretation of the
    M4 performance idea.
</p>


<h2 style="color:#4da6ff;">
    12. THE M4 CSL
</h2>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    In 2022 BMW introduced the <b>M4 CSL</b>.
</p>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    CSL represents a lightweight performance philosophy.
</p>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    The M4 CSL used weight reduction, increased performance
    and a more focused setup to make the car more suitable
    for track driving.
