<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    Racing gives engineers a difficult environment in which
    to test their ideas.
</p>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    Cars have to accelerate, brake, turn, manage heat and
    remain reliable under extreme conditions.
</p>

