<!-- FUTURE -->

<h1 style="text-align:center; color:#c77dff; font-size:270%;">
    THE FUTURE OF SPEED
</h1>

<h2 style="text-align:center; color:#ffffff;">
    WHAT COULD CARS BECOME?
</h2>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    Now we leave the real history and enter the world of
    possibilities.
</p>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    Some of these technologies are already being developed.
    Others are imaginative ideas about what the future might bring.
</p>


<h2 style="color:#c77dff;">
    1. ELECTRIC PERFORMANCE
</h2>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    Electric motors can deliver power very quickly.
</p>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    Future performance cars could combine electric motors,
    advanced batteries and intelligent software.
</p>


<h2 style="color:#c77dff;">
    2. HYBRID SPORTS CARS
</h2>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    Hybrid technology combines different power systems.
</p>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    A future sports car could combine an engine with
    electric motors to improve acceleration, efficiency
    and overall performance.
</p>


<h2 style="color:#c77dff;">
    3. ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE
</h2>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    Imagine a car that can understand what is happening
    around it using cameras, sensors and artificial intelligence.
</p>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    It could recognise road conditions, traffic and potential
    hazards and provide useful information to the driver.
</p>


<h2 style="color:#c77dff;">
    4. SMART ROADS
</h2>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    What if roads could communicate with cars?
</p>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    A smart road could send information about traffic,
    accidents, weather or dangerous conditions.
</p>


<h2 style="color:#c77dff;">
    5. CARS TALKING TO CARS
</h2>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    Future vehicles could communicate with nearby vehicles.
</p>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    One vehicle could warn another about sudden braking
    or traffic ahead.
</p>


<h2 style="color:#c77dff;">
    6. INTELLIGENT SPEED CONTROL
</h2>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    Imagine a car that understands the speed limit,
    traffic, weather and road conditions.
</p>

<p style="text-align:center; font-size:145%; color:#c77dff;">
    <b>
        "How intelligently can this car control its speed?"
    </b>
</p>


<h2 style="color:#c77dff;">
    7. WHAT IF CARS COULD FLY?
</h2>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    Imagine a Porsche or BMW leaving the road and travelling
    through the air.
</p>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    A flying vehicle would need completely different technology:
    flight controls, sensors, navigation, propulsion and
    extremely advanced safety systems.
</p>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    Flying cars remain largely a futuristic concept,
    but engineers are exploring new forms of aerial mobility.
</p>

