</h2>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    Porsche has repeatedly shown that it can introduce new
    technology without abandoning the identity of the 911.
</p>

<p style="font-size:120%; color:#e8edf7;">
    Future Porsche sports cars could use more advanced
    electric and hybrid systems, software and intelligent
    performance technology.
</p>

